00022 013C 	; 1.0b5  5/25/2018	RS232_MasterAddr, RS232_SlaveAddr now in ram
00023 013C 	; 1.0d4  5/18/2018	Added RS232_ClearTXData, RS232_Send.
00024 013C 	; 1.0d3  5/17/2018	Used Timer1Lo for RXTimeout.
00025 013C 	; 1.0d2  4/26/2018	Comments, used in robot arm project.
